service_manual/pages/

# A local convenience symlink to _site/ so that the site's baseurl-prefixed URLs resolve when
# browsing the built site from disk. It MUST NOT be tracked: on GitHub Pages
# _site does not exist when the build starts, so realpath on this link fails with
#   No such file or directory @ rb_check_realpath_internal - /github/workspace/technics-docs
# which aborts the build. Committed by mistake in a6f2303 (2026-07-10), and again in
# 8af927a (2026-09-24), when this entry was renamed to follow the repository while the
# link on disk kept its old name. Both names are listed so either one stays untracked.
# Gate before pushing a rename (must print nothing -- the site tracks no symlinks):
#   git ls-files -s | awk '$1 == "120000"'
KN5000-docs
technics-docs
